WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.035
- CARVELL
THANKS YOU FOR COMING.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.103
[sighs] FIRST ORDER OF BUSINESS,
I'M SURE YOU ALL HEARD

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.271
THAT TWIGS GOT PULLED
OUT THE RIVER THIS MORNING.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.340
IT AIN'T NO SECRET

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.442
THAT HE AND CARVELL
GREW UP IN THE HOOD TOGETHER.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.744
SO LISTEN UP.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:15.448
'CAUSE CARVELL
ABOUT TO SAY SOME WORDS.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:21.454
- [panting]

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.358
- OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:27.093
DON'T NONE OF YOU
LOOK AT THEM TEARS

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.295
AND THINK THAT [bleep]
IS FUNNY.

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:32.665
BECAUSE IT TAKES A BIG [bleep]
MAN TO CRY IN FRONT OF HIS CREW.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:36.770
GO AHEAD, CARVELL.
- [sniffles]

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:42.142
Y'ALL KNOW TWIGS WAS MY BOY.

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:47.780
BACK IN THE DAY,

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:50.783
WE USED TO PRETEND
THE SOFA CUSHIONS WAS A FORT.

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:54.454
- MM-HMM, MM-HMM.
[takes breath]

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:56.889
- AND WE USED TO PRETEND
THAT THE FLOOR WAS MOLTEN LAVA.

00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:58.091
OH...

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.959
[panting]

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:03.229
- OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT,
THOUGH?

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:06.499
THERE AIN'T NOTHING FUNNY
'BOUT THAT.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.601
OF COURSE THIS MAN IS CRYING.

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:12.972
'CAUSE HE AND TWIGS
WAS KIDS TOGETHER. OKAY?

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:14.907
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.676
THEY WAS BEST FRIENDS
FOREVER AND [bleep].

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:20.213
- [sniffles]
- GO AHEAD, CARVELL.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:23.049
- WE USED TO PLAY
<i> CARE BEARS.</i>

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.751
- MMM-HMM.
HMM-HMM.

00:01:25.784 --> 00:01:29.755
- TWIGS AND I WOULD SPEND

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:31.791
THE GOOD PART
OF AN AFTERNOON

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:35.828
TRYING TO FIGURE OUT
WHICH C-C-CARE BEAR WE WAS.

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:38.998
- OH, OH...
[chuckling]

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:40.766
OH...

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.835
I WISH ONE OF Y'ALL
MOTHER-[bleep]

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.071
WOULD JUST START LAUGHING,

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:48.674
'CAUSE YOU ALL KNOW
YOU THINK THIS [bleep] IS FUNNY.

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:52.612
CARVELL OVER HERE, BLUBBERING
AND TALKING 'BOUT<i> CARE BEARS.</i>

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:57.683
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:57.716 --> 00:01:59.485
BUT YOU...

00:01:59.518 --> 00:02:01.454
- [holding back sobs]

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:05.758
- [wheezes]

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.461
THOSE ARE MANLY TEARS!
OKAY?

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:13.199
THOSE SOME MANLY-ASS TEARS
RIGHT THERE THAT YOU LOOKIN' AT!

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:17.003
GO AHEAD, CARVELL.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.005
- AND THEN--

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.041
AND THEN--AND THEN--
AND THEN--AND--AND--AND--

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:24.143
[blubbering]

00:02:24.176 --> 00:02:26.212
- [laughs]
MM, I'M SORRY, MAN.

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:27.280
THAT WAS A WEIRD-ASS SNEEZE
I JUST DID RIGHT THERE.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.315
GOD DAMN IT.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.684
CAN A BROTHER GET SOME [bleep]
CLARITIN UP IN HERE?

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.824
GO AHEAD, CARVELL.

00:02:38.857 --> 00:02:42.261
- TWIGS ALWAYS
FANCIED HIMSELF SHARE BEAR.

00:02:42.294 --> 00:02:43.396
- MM--

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:46.232
[groaning laugh]

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:47.400
- I ALWAYS--

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.535
I ALWAYS THOUGHT--

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:53.005
THOUGHT OF MYSELF
AS MORE OF A FUNSHINE BEAR.

00:02:53.038 --> 00:02:55.141
- MM--OKAY.

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:57.276
OKAY, ALL YOU [bleep] NEED
TO RESPECT THAT RIGHT THERE!

00:02:57.309 --> 00:02:59.111
OKAY?

00:02:59.144 --> 00:03:01.180
Y'ALL NEED TO LISTEN
TO FUNSHI--

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:05.751
[laughs]

00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:08.854
[howling laughter]

00:03:08.887 --> 00:03:11.591
I'M SO--I'M SORRY, MAN.

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:14.060
YOU A FUNSHINE BEAR, MAN.
I'M SORRY, THAT--

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:18.864
THAT IS SOME FUNNY [bleep].
[laughs]

00:03:18.897 --> 00:03:21.901
[gunshot]
- WHOA, WHOA.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.637
- [heaves]

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.172
ALL RIGHT.
LET'S GO SELL SOME CRACK.

